      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Blow air into your microphone, you may just have dust in it I think\n\nTry also adjusting your audio settings with a friend helping you\n\nTry noise suppression on, try turning the output down (maybe 80%-95%?), etc\n\nThe Quest 3 (and Pro) mics have a crackling/popping noise when they are turned up too much in the VRChat and/or Quest settings",
