  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Voice when using Quest 3 is not clear and is heard by other users as \"crackling\". To reproduce the defect:\n\n- Open VRChat on a Quest 3 device\n\n- Enter any world\n\n- Talk to other visitors\n\n- Ask them if they can hear clearly your voice without a strange \"crackling\" effect",
